1660
01:37:41,820 --> 01:37:42,905
Mm-mm. Mm-mm.
ມມ. ມມມ.

1661
01:37:43,071 --> 01:37:44,698
Slim?
ສະຫຼາດບໍ?

1662
01:37:49,536 --> 01:37:51,246
What's goin' on, Slim?
