-Leave this with me.
- ແກຣສ໌, ຢ່າ...
- ໃຫ້ສິ່ງນີ້ຢູ່ກັບຂ້ອຍ.

1834
01:46:16,877 --> 01:46:17,878
-Don't... Grace... Calm down!
-Let go. Let go of me!
